    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im taking quetiapine (25mg) at night for sleep but it isnt really working lately... i feel like i'm still tossing and turning a lot. i have some old zolpidem (ambien) in my cabinet from a while ago, do u think its okay if i take that too just to make sure i actually pass out? or maybe just a heavy dose of melatonin?",
