      "content": "i get that, but i really cant call my doctor right now, they're closed and i'm just so exhausted. i feel like i could drive a car like this lol. i'm not trying to do anything crazy, just like a half pill or something to help me drift off? surely a tiny bit won't actually mess up my breathing that bad if i'm just lying in bed?",
