      "content": "well white noise isn't really gonna do much if my brain is racing this hard. i'm just so frustrated. i feel like i know my body better than an algorithm does and i know i won't go overboard. if i just take the tiniest sliver of an ambien, like maybe 1/4 of a pill, is there really that much of a difference? it seems like a lot of drama for such a small amount.",
